msgctxt "settings.reader.fileNaming.crossPlatformHint"
msgid ""
"Make generated file and folder names safe on Windows by replacing invalid characters and reserved "
"names, and removing trailing dots and spaces. Disable only for Linux-only setups that "
"intentionally keep those characters."
