msgctxt "settings.reader.kobo.convertKepubHint"
msgid ""
"Send eligible EPUBs as KEPUB. This stays on when progress sync or BookOrbit-to-Kobo highlights "
"are enabled. On the next Kobo sync, affected books are offered again as KEPUB downloads; remove "
"any old EPUB copy if Kobo keeps opening it."
msgstr ""
